QuestGuidance.Register("en",273,{
[8705]="7006D19D\n1\tComplete Mission: Counterattack at Wrackwade\tYour mission is to help the Dumûri counterattack and regain control of the Wrackwade. As you secure sections of the bridge, raise Ambarûli banners to lay claim to them. Talk to Khâdamul when you are ready for battle.\n2\tSpeak with Khâdamul in Iridír\tThe counterattack is successful! You have helped the Dumûri regain control of the Wrackwade. Return with Khâdamul to report your victory.\n",
[8706]="70062BF3\n1\tFind and defeat the true leader of the Orc forces at Caranost\tAtop the Crown of Caranost, the true leader of the invading Orcs resides in power. Search the apex of the ruins for the servant of evil masterminding this invasion.\n2\tFind the Scout\t\n",
[8707]="70062C6F\n1\tComplete the Mission: Crown of Caranost\tSpeak with the mission giver to make a final assault on the crown of Caranost.\n2\tTalk to Baglan\tAfter defeating the Uruk-hai leader in the fortress at Caranost you should return to the mission giver and let them know what you have learned.\n",
[8708]="7005C8A5\n1\tComplete Mission: Crystal Conundrum\tYour mission is to carefully mine crystals within Mesem-gairu and bring them back to Horin. Speak to Horin to travel to Mesem-gairu.\n2\tTalk to Horin\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Horin for your reward!\n",
[8709]="7005C8C3\n1\tMine crystals (total: 12)\030Destroy crystal spider nests (total: 8)\tContinue to mine crystals and destroy crystal spider nests\n2\tReturn to the entrance of the cave\tYou should return to the entrance of the cave.\n",
[8710]="7005C064\n1\tDefeat Ramshar, the corrupted warg\030Destroy corrupted crystals (total: 8)\tYou should seek out and destroy the corrupted crystals, and defeat the corrupted pack leader Ramshar.\n2\tRegroup near the entrance to the cave\tYou should regroup near the entrance to the cave.\n",
[8711]="7005C065\n1\tComplete Mission: Culling the Rot\tYour mission is to destroy corrupted crystals in the cavern, and seek out the warg pack-leader. Speak to Ausma to travel to the warg-infested cavern.\n2\tTalk to Ausma\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Ausma for your reward!\n",
[8712]="7005A1C0\n1\tTEMPLATE\tDNT\n",
[8713]="70062FBE\n1\tDeliver 60 pies to Glyn Helyg villagers ([see journal]/60)\t\n2\tDefeat the attacking brigands (total: 15)\t\n3\tFind and speak with a Scout\t\n",
[8714]="70063036\n1\tComplete the Mission: Dangerous Deliveries\tHelping with deliveries in the small cliffside village of Glyn Helyg might be the respite you need. Speak with the mission giver to embark on the journey of relaxation.\n2\tTalk to Irvo Curch\tIn a rather unexpected turn of events, there were brigands who decided to make their way into the village at night. Fortunately, you were there and able to drive them off.\n",
[8715]="7005A81A\n1\tComplete Mission: Darkness in the Mist\tYour mission is to protect the outpost of Hrimbarg in the Misty Mountains. Speak to Hórin to travel to Hrimbarg.\n2\tTalk to Hórin\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Hórin for your reward!\n",
[8716]="7005A81D\n1\tTalk to Thorgest\tTalk to Thorgest.\n2\tHead to the Hrimbarg's courtyard!\t\n3\tDefeat the drake invasion\030Defend Hrimbarg\tDefend Hrimbarg. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
[8717]="70070CFE\n1\tComplete Mission: Defence of the Elderwell\tYour mission is to travel to the Elderwell to the west and assist the Sul Madásh scholar Arvunath while she investigates the ruins. Speak to Várudar to travel.\n2\tReturn to Várudar in Sul Madásh\tYou have successfully defended Arvunath from the Orc attack at the Elderwell. She was able to complete her investigation and return back to Sul Madásh safely.\n",
[8718]="7006C536\n1\tComplete Mission: Defend the River\tYour mission is to travel to the river near Maurûsh and stop the Orcs there from poisoning the tributary. Speak to Ashâmi to travel.\n2\tTalk to Ashâmi\tYou have successfully stopped the Orcs from poisoning the river! Return with the scout to Ashâmi with this report.\n",
[8719]="70059850\n1\tDefeat Orc-defilers in the Dimrill Dale (total: 8)\030Destroy blighted cauldrons in the Dimrill Dale (total: 6)\tYour mission is to defeat Orc-defilers that have come out of Moria and destroy their cauldrons of blight.\n",
[8720]="70059859\n1\tComplete 'Mission: Defilers in the Dale'\tYour mission is to defeat Orc-defilers that have come out of Moria and destroy their cauldrons of blight. You should talk to Vorthur Smokebreath and travel to the Dimrill Dale.\n2\tTalk to Vorthur Smokebreath\tYou have completed your mission. You should talk to Vorthur Smokebreath at Akrâz-zahar.\n",
[8721]="70057F1E\n1\tDefeat hobgoblins (total: 10)\tDefeat hobgoblins in Vorkodar.\n",
[8722]="70057F1F\n1\tComplete Mission: Den of the Frost-bound\tYour mission is to defeat hobgoblins in Vorkodar. Speak to Ausma to travel to Vorkodar.\n2\tTalk to Ausma\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Ausma for your reward!\n",
[8723]="7006C50C\n1\tComplete Mission: Deny Their Venom\tYour mission is to travel to Dul Râkh and defeat the Anâkhi cultists there in an attempt to prevent them from continuing their practice of using usan-kûni poison glands on their blades. If you can, defeat their head apothecary Goródha as well. Speak with Raphûz to travel.\n2\tTalk to Raphûz\tYou have successfully slain the Anâkhi cultists and their head apothecary Goródha! Return with the scout to Raphûz with this report.\n",
[8724]="7007301D\n1\tComplete Mission: Disrupting Control\tYour mission is to enter the area, free the minds of servants within, retrieve any goods, and escape.\n2\tSpeak with Shâpar in Ahaba\tYou have freed the servants, gathered the supplies, and escaped.\n",
[8725]="70057F17\n1\tDefeat Dourhand mine-overseers (total: 4)\030Defeat Dourhand blasters (total: 6)\030Defeat Dourhand excavators (total: 10)\tDefeat Dourhands in Glimmerdeep.\n",
[8726]="70057F4F\n1\tComplete Mission: Dourhands in the Deep\tYour mission is to defeat Dourhands in Glimmerdeep. Speak to Ausma to travel to Glimmerdeep.\n2\tTalk to Ausma\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Ausma for your reward!\n",
[8727]="70062BE9\n1\tDefeat the goblin leader\t\n2\tFind and speak with the scout\t\n",
[8728]="70062CE0\n1\tComplete the Mission: Down on the Farm\tThe farmers who lost their farm in the South Downs desire to visit retribution on the goblins who destroyed their home and livelihood. You are tasked with defeating the goblin leader residing there.\n2\tTalk to Baglan\tThe goblin leader is slain and now you can return to the mission giver and let them know of your success.\n",
[8729]="7005A648\n1\tComplete Mission: Drakes Up Above\tYour mission is to investigate drakes in High Sundergrot. Speak to Ausma to travel to High Sundergrot.\n2\tTalk to Ausma\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Ausma for your reward!\n",
[8730]="7005A649\n1\tInvestigate drake tracks (total: 10)\030Destroy drake eggs (total: 12)\tInvestigate drake tracks and destroy drake eggs along High Sundergrót.\n2\tDestroy the drake matron's nest\tDestroy the drake matron's nest.\n",
[8731]="7005C416\n1\tDefeat Frost-horde Hobgoblin Emissaries (total: 12)\030Destroy ice pillars (total: 10)\tYou should defeat Frost-horde Hobgoblin Emissaries and destroy ice pillars spread around the area.\n2\tRegroup near the bridge in the mountain pass\tYou should regroup near the bridge in the mountain pass.\n",
[8732]="7005C417\n1\tComplete Mission: Drive a Wedge\tYour mission is to defeat Frost-horde Hobgoblin Emissaries and destroy ice pillars. Speak to Hórin to travel to the mountain pass.\n2\tTalk to Hórin\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Hórin for your reward!\n",
[8733]="7006C124\n1\tComplete Mission: Dulling the Weapons of War\tYour mission is to destroy Orkish weapons racks and defeat Orcs in Tharháth, near the Span of Nâmbadir. Speak to Udlanu to travel.\n2\tSpeak with Udlanu in Urmâkh\tYou have defeated the Orcs and destroyed their weapons! Return with the scout to Udlanu in Urmâkh with this report.\n",
[8734]="70058104\n1\tComplete Mission: Emissary at the Goblin-gate\tYour mission is to defeat Blúghosh, Emissary of Gorgar, at the Goblin-gate. Speak to Ausma to travel to the Goblin-gate.\n2\tTalk to Ausma\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Ausma for your reward!\n",
[8735]="70058107\n1\tDefeat Blúghosh, Emissary of Gorgar\tDefeat Blúghosh, Emissary of Gorgar at the Goblin-gate.\n",
[8736]="70059854\n1\tDefeat Orcs at the East-gate of Moria (total: 12)\tYour mission is to defeat the Pûlpum gate-captain and Orcs camped at the East-gate of Moria.\n2\tDestroy the Orkish gate at the East-gate of Moria\tYour mission is to defeat the Pûlpum gate-captain and Orcs camped at the East-gate of Moria.\n3\tDefeat the Pûlpum gate-captain and his guards\tYour mission is to defeat the Pûlpum gate-captain and Orcs camped at the East-gate of Moria.\n",
